Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] Guard native-only Java APIs

Register renderer and shell JNI methods supported by the native-only product.
Reject runtime, template, SSR, and engine-reuse APIs in Java before their
intentionally omitted JNI methods can be reached. Resolve the event-thread
query directly from the native-only thread strategy and cover the public API
boundary on Android.
